EVERYTHING ABOUT IT IS CHANGED.

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:29.095
ESPECIALLY EARLY AFTER THE
STROKE, THE ABILITY TO REALLY

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:32.732
UNDERSTAND WHAT EXACTLY WHAT I'M
BEING HEARD IS -- BUT IT GETS

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:36.202
MUCH, MUCH BETTER WHERE I TAKE
IN A LOT BUT TO BE PRECISE I USE

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:41.040
CAPTIONING SO THAT'S REALLY THE
MAJOR CHALLENGE.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:45.078
&gt;&gt; CNN'S CHIEF MEDICAL
CORRESPONDENT SANJAY GUPTA IS

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:47.881
