YOU.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:00:58.892
&gt;&gt; YEAH, IT'S REALLY INTERESTING
BECAUSE YOU REALLY GET INSIGHT

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:03.796
INTO HOW A STROKE CAN AFFECT A
PARTICULAR PART OF THE BRAIN AND

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:06.132
