AS WELL.

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.901
JUST SHOW YOU HERE, AGAIN, THIS
IS REALLY INTERESTING BUT A

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:12.638
BRAIN MODEL, LEFT SIDE OF THE
BRAIN IS TYPICALLY WHERE PEOPLE

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:15.275
